            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 1–10</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "bodyHtml": "<p>Complete the form below. Write <strong>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p><div><div class=\"notes-title\"><strong>Oz Housesitters — Home Owner Registration Form</strong></div><ul><li><strong>Name:</strong> Jenny Hall</li><li><strong>Address:</strong> 14 {{1}} St, Greenfield</li><li><strong>Mobile no:</strong> {{2}}</li><li><strong>Date required from:</strong> {{3}}</li><li><strong>Length of time required:</strong> {{4}} weeks</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">House features</p><ul><li>it has a new {{5}}</li><li>it is near a station</li><li>there is room for the housesitter's {{6}}</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">Special duties required</p><ul><li>water the {{7}} tree</li></ul><p class=\"sub-head\">Housesitter requirements</p><ul><li>the house is large so a {{8}} is preferred</li><li>no {{9}} allowed</li><li>would like a check carried out by the {{10}}</li></ul></div>",
            "maxWords": 2
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "number": 2,
        "title": "Part 2",
        "instructionsHtml": "<p>Listen and answer questions 11–20.</p>",
        "groups": [
          {
            "id": "part-2-group-1",
            "type": "mcq",
            "rubricHtml": "<p>Questions 11–16</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "questions": [
              {
                "number": 11,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;Arthur feels that when starting a business, mistakes should be",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "seen as an opportunity to learn."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "predicted and minimised."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "avoided at all costs"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 12,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;Recent American studies found that confidence will",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "sometimes reduce people's chances of success."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "be increased by reading self-help books."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "ensure good results on business courses."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 13,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;The American studies recommended that new entrepreneurs",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "listen to their colleagues' advice."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "get professional help when things go wrong."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "remain concentrated on their aims."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 14,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What does Arthur say about his own experience of marketing?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "He relied on what he already knew."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "He hired an expert to take care of it."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "He realised its importance too late."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 15,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What does Arthur think is an important quality shared by good leaders?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "They are ambitious for their company."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "They can deal with difficult people."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "They earn the respect of their workforce."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "number": 16,
                "textHtml": "&nbsp;What does Arthur say about taking risks?",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "letter": "A",
                    "textHtml": "He advises being cautious."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "B",
                    "textHtml": "He favours a long-term view."
                  },
                  {
                    "letter": "C",
                    "textHtml": "He believes it is financially advantageous."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "part-2-group-2",
            "type": "mcq",
